Description: Mass spectrometry (MS) data backend for data storage in NoSQL
             MongoDB dagabases. Objects from this package expand the data
	     storage and handling infrastructure of the Spectra Bioconductor
	     package. This package adds support to store and retrieve MS data
	     from MongoDB databases.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.5.0),
    Spectra (>= 1.19.8)
